{
  "title": "Well-Architected · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "여러 설계 관점으로 아키텍처의 품질과 개선점을 점검합니다.",
  "main": "<nav aria-label=\"현재 위치\" class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Well-Architected</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open=\"\"><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/well/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/well/#guide-1\">여섯 가지 검토 관점</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/well/#guide-2\">검토 결과를 개선으로 연결하기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/well/#visual\">구성 한눈에 보기</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/well/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/well/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/well/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>기초</span><span>62 / 62</span></div><h1>Well-Architected</h1></header><section class=\"overview\" id=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Well-Architected는 <strong>AWS 아키텍처를 체계적으로 점검하는 설계 프레임워크</strong>입니다. 특정 서비스 하나를 고르는 기준을 넘어 운영, 보안, 장애 대응, 성능, 비용, 자원 사용을 함께 살펴봅니다.</p><p>한 요구를 만족시키는 설계가 다른 요구에도 적합한지 확인하는 데 도움이 됩니다. 예를 들어 복제본을 늘리면 가용성은 높아질 수 있지만 비용과 운영 부담도 달라집니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-1\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"operational-excellence\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"security\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"reliability\"></span><h2>여섯 가지 검토 관점</h2><p><strong>운영 우수성·보안:</strong> 변경을 안전하게 배포하고 상태를 관찰할 수 있는지, 신원과 데이터가 적절히 보호되는지 확인합니다.</p><p><strong>안정성·성능 효율성:</strong> 장애에서 복구하고 수요 변화에 대응할 수 있는지, 작업에 맞는 기술과 자원을 사용하는지 확인합니다.</p><p><strong>비용 최적화·지속 가능성:</strong> 필요한 가치에 맞게 비용을 쓰는지, 불필요한 자원 소비를 줄이고 이용률을 높이는지 검토합니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section concept-guide\" id=\"guide-2\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"performance-efficiency\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"cost-optimization\"></span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"concept-anchor\" id=\"sustainability\"></span><h2>검토 결과를 개선으로 연결하기</h2><p>현재 업무의 목표와 제약을 적고, 각 관점에서 위험을 찾습니다. 장애 테스트, 비용 분석, 권한 검토 등으로 실제 근거를 확인합니다.</p><p>모든 기능을 한꺼번에 추가하기보다 영향이 큰 위험부터 우선순위를 정해 개선합니다. 서비스 규모와 요구가 바뀌면 같은 관점으로 다시 검토합니다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" id=\"visual\"><figure class=\"diagram concept-diagram\"><figcaption><b>아키텍처 검토와 개선</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><ol class=\"concept-flow\"><li><strong>업무 목표</strong><span>요구사항·제약 확인</span></li><li><strong>여섯 관점 검토</strong><span>위험과 근거 확인</span></li><li><strong>개선 실행</strong><span>우선순위·효과 점검</span></li></ol><p class=\"diagram-note\">한 번의 점검으로 끝내지 않고 운영 중에도 반복합니다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"scenario\" id=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>신규 서비스의 권한, 백업 복구 시간, 최대 부하 성능, 예상 비용을 함께 검토합니다. 가장 큰 위험부터 개선하고 결과를 다시 측정합니다.</p></section><section class=\"references\" id=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/wellarchitected/latest/framework/the-pillars-of-the-framework.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">The pillars of the framework ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section class=\"related-questions\" id=\"practice\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q004/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q004\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q004\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q004</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q004/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Cost optimization and reliability requirements appear to conflict. What is the best architectural decision?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q004\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Increase only the EC2 instance size</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q004\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Evaluate business RPO and RTO requirements alongside cost</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q004\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Replicate every system across multiple Regions</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q004\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Always choose the least expensive single-AZ deployment</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/well/\">Well-Architected</a>는 여러 기둥의 요구와 균형을 함께 평가한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/well/\">Well-Architected</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/\">Budgets / Cost Explorer</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"0\" data-question=\"Q001\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q001\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q001</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q001/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An application must remain available during a prolonged outage of the entire Seoul Region. What is the minimum scope for replication?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q001\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A different AWS Region</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q001\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A different subnet in the Seoul Region</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q001\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A different Availability Zone in the Seoul Region</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q001\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A different ENI in the same Availability Zone</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 분리는 한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 안의 장애를 다룬다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 수준 장애는 별도 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 복제와 전환이 필요하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q099\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q099\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q099</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q099/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A service runs in two AZs, but recovery from a Region outage takes a week. What improvement addresses an RTO requirement of one hour?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q099\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Add another EC2 instance in the same AZ</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q099\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Change only the network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q099\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Assign a fixed Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q099\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Prepare a recovery environment and failover procedure in another Region</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 장애 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-time-objective\">RTO</a>를 줄이려면 다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a>에서 정해진 시간 내 서비스를 켤 수 있는 DR 환경과 검증이 필요하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">RPO / RTO</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"1\" data-question=\"Q098\" data-revision=\"2\" id=\"question-Q098\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q098</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q098/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company has a Compute Savings Plan but must also ensure that matching EC2 capacity is available in one specific Availability Zone for a launch. Which additional option should it configure?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q098\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A regional Reserved Instance only</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q098\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An On-Demand Capacity Reservation</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q098\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An S3 reservation</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q098\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A Spot Fleet with no On-Demand capacity</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#compute-savings-plans\">Savings Plans</a>는 사용 비용 할인이며 Capacity를 예약하지 않는다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-capacity-reservations\">On-Demand Capacity Reservation</a>은 지정 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>·구성의 실행 용량을 확보한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#regional-and-zonal-reserved-instances\">Regional RI</a>도 Capacity를 예약하지 않는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">EC2 Purchasing Options</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/cost/\">Budgets / Cost Explorer</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" data-correct=\"3\" data-question=\"Q002\" data-revision=\"1\" id=\"question-Q002\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q002</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q002/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A web tier must withstand a data center failure within one Region. Which deployment is most appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q002\" type=\"radio\" value=\"0\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Two ENIs on the same EC2 instance</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q002\" type=\"radio\" value=\"1\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Two instances using one EBS volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q002\" type=\"radio\" value=\"2\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Two instances in a single Availability Zone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input name=\"answer-Q002\" type=\"radio\" value=\"3\"/><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Instances deployed across different Availability Zones</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>는 독립적인 장애 영역이다. 서로 다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">서브넷</a>에 웹 인스턴스를 둔다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article></section><nav aria-label=\"용어 이동\" class=\"sequence\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/waf/\">이전 용어 <b>WAF / Shield</b></a></span><span></span></nav></div></div>"
}
